    "detailed_description": "<h1>Deluxe Edition</h1><p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2129050/extras/1d8c13513ea314f123cd9ef1de140496.avif?t=1680283059\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2129050/extras/0cae3df141c8874950ac2f091c039fd0.avif?t=1680283059\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A super special deluxe edition which contains:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> The game<br></li><li> A 60-page book telling the story of the game<br></li><li> 3 exclusive wallpapers<br></li><li> The game soundtrack (5 original songs)<br></li><li> The game sketchbook<br></li><li> 5 Steampunk coloring pages</li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2129050/extras/c722f601885d4482df26f55efb45336a.avif?t=1680283059\" /></div><br><strong><i>REX </i></strong>it's a <strong><i>Roguelike/Shoot'em'up/Melee</i></strong> game with infinite gameplay and a variety of features and builds. You will control Rex, an alcoholic cat with a weak memory but a noble mission: to save the world from the evil Draconians.<br><br>You will fight against them in different scenarios with various builds, powers, and magic. Each round, the enemies become stronger and appear in greater numbers, but you will also become stronger.<br><br>You and Rex are the world's last hope, so create a powerful build, climb the leaderboard, and save the world in this beautiful steampunk magic fantasy.<br>                                                            <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2129050/extras/7e48a853788c3dce9cdea3d65c07a624.poster.avif?t=1680283059\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2129050/extras/7e48a853788c3dce9cdea3d65c07a624.webm?t=1680283059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2129050/extras/7e48a853788c3dce9cdea3d65c07a624.mp4?t=1680283059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2129050/extras/76eb295217d6d9cb09c9f9fc48a3ff50.avif?t=1680283059\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 3 different scenarios<br></li><li> Melee mechanics<br></li><li>  Roguelike Deckbuilder mechanics<br></li><li> Steampunk Theme<br></li><li> 1 boss every 20 levels<br></li><li>A leaderboard system, with world, national and local ranks.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2129050/extras/810e8959f858ccaa37008413ee71d19d.avif?t=1680283059\" /></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2129050/extras/c722f601885d4482df26f55efb45336a.avif?t=1680283059\" /></div><br><strong><i>REX </i></strong>it's a <strong><i>Roguelike/Shoot'em'up/Melee</i></strong> game with infinite gameplay and a variety of features and builds. You will control Rex, an alcoholic cat with a weak memory but a noble mission: to save the world from the evil Draconians.<br><br>You will fight against them in different scenarios with various builds, powers, and magic. Each round, the enemies become stronger and appear in greater numbers, but you will also become stronger.<br><br>You and Rex are the world's last hope, so create a powerful build, climb the leaderboard, and save the world in this beautiful steampunk magic fantasy.<br>                                                            <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2129050/extras/7e48a853788c3dce9cdea3d65c07a624.poster.avif?t=1680283059\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2129050/extras/7e48a853788c3dce9cdea3d65c07a624.webm?t=1680283059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2129050/extras/7e48a853788c3dce9cdea3d65c07a624.mp4?t=1680283059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2129050/extras/76eb295217d6d9cb09c9f9fc48a3ff50.avif?t=1680283059\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 3 different scenarios<br></li><li> Melee mechanics<br></li><li>  Roguelike Deckbuilder mechanics<br></li><li> Steampunk Theme<br></li><li> 1 boss every 20 levels<br></li><li>A leaderboard system, with world, national and local ranks.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2129050/extras/810e8959f858ccaa37008413ee71d19d.avif?t=1680283059\" /></div>",
    "short_description": "Are you up for the challenge of breaking this crazy game with crazy builds? Can you take control of Rex the cat and defeat the evil Draconians? Can you earn a spot on the leaderboard? If you're ready for all of that, buy REX today and enjoy this exciting roguelike game with a steampunk theme",
